LOW /                  4.53E+21 -1.81 4.92E+02 /
TROE /                 7.300E-01 1.00E-30 1.00E+30 1.00E+30 /
O2 / 1.00 /
H2 / 1.50 /
H2O / 13.00 / 
!___________________________________________________________________________________________________________ 
!\REACTIONCLASS: RH+R_ABSTRACTION
!___________________________________________________________________________________________________________ 
OH+OH=H2O+O            2.88E+06 1.79 -1.75E+03 !\Author: WARNING !\Ref: G. ALTINAY, J. PHYS. CHEM. A, 118(2014), PP. 38-54 !\Comment: WARNING 
!___________________________________________________________________________________________________________ 
!\REACTIONCLASS: RADICAL_ALPHA_SCISSION
!___________________________________________________________________________________________________________ 
O+H+M<=>OH+M           4.714E+18 -1.00 0.00 !\Author: AK !\Ref: TSANG AND HAMPSON, J. PHYS. CHEM. REF. DATA, 15 !\Comment: WARNING 
H2 / 2.5000 /
H2O / 12.0000 / 
