OH(v)+OH=OH+OH         1.50E+12 5.00E-01 0.00E+00 !\Author: ABS !\Ref: HALL AND PETERSEN IJCK 2006 !\Comment: WARNING 
OH(v)+H=OH+H           1.50E+12 5.00E-01 0.00!\Author: ABS !\Ref: HALL AND PETERSEN IJCK 2006 !\Comment: WARNING 
OH(v)=OH               1.40E+06 0.00 0.00 !\Author: ABS !\Ref: HALL AND PETERSEN IJCK 2006 !\Comment: WARNING 
OH(v)+O2=OH+O2         2.10E+12 5.00E-01 -4.82E+02 !\Author: ABS !\Ref: HALL AND PETERSEN IJCK 2006 !\Comment: WARNING 
OH(v)+O=OH+O           1.50E+12 5.00E-01 0.00 !\Author: ABS !\Ref: HALL AND PETERSEN IJCK 2006 !\Comment: WARNING 
