DUP
H2O2+OH=H2O+HO2        7.59E+13 0.00 7.269E+03 !\Author: AK !\Ref: HONG ET AL. J. PHYS. CHEM. A 114(2010) 5718-5727 !\Comment: WARNING 
DUP
