O3+H=O2+OH             8.43E+13 0.0 9.34E+02 !\Author: WARNING !\Ref: DeMore, W.B.; Sander, S.P.; Golden, D.M.; Hampson, R.F.; Kurylo, M.J.; Howard, C.J.; Ravishankara, A.R.; Kolb, C.E.; Molina, M.J., JPL Publication 97-4(1997) 1 - 266 !\Comment: WARNING
O3+H=O+HO2             4.52E+11 0.0 0.00E+00 !\Author: WARNING !\Ref: Howard, C.J.; Finlayson-Pitts, B.J., J. Chem. Phys. 72(1980) !\Comment: WARNING

O3+OH=O2+HO2           1.85E+11 0.0 8.31E+02 !\Author: WARNING !\Ref: Mansergas, A.; Anglada, J.M., CHEMPHYSCHEM 8(2007) 1534 - 1539 !\Comment: WARNING

